WEBVTT

00:05:58.312 --> 00:06:01.232
To document the stories
of those who never got to tell theirs,

00:06:01.273 --> 00:06:03.609
and to collect vital
statistical information

00:06:03.609 --> 00:06:07.279
from the community on where resources
and support are needed.

00:06:07.321 --> 00:06:10.658
Features such as blogs,
archives and surveys

00:06:10.658 --> 00:06:16.038
give us the opportunity to document
our past and articulate our future

00:06:16.038 --> 00:06:18.874
and to share where direct
resources are needed.

00:06:19.708 --> 00:06:24.839
There's an immense gap on the research
on the experiences of queer Africans,

00:06:24.880 --> 00:06:28.509
which is often weaponized against us
to suggest that we don't exist.

00:06:28.843 --> 00:06:31.804
If governments aren't collecting
information on suicide rates